<title>UK: UK'S HOLLIDAY CHEMICAL H1 PROFITS SURGE.</title>
<headline>UK'S HOLLIDAY CHEMICAL H1 PROFITS SURGE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  8.8		  vs   5.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   2.5		  vs   2.1</p>
<p> Pretax			13.38		 vs   8.14</p>
<p> Turnover		    87.26		 vs  85.46</p>
<p>Full company name - Holliday Chemical Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Note: The company said its current order book was &quot;healthy&quot; with its performance ahead of the same period last year. It said if sterling rates remained at current levels, the impact in the second half would be 1.7 million stg. The company's share price was up 23 1/2 pence at 176 1/2 at 0750 GMT.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
